[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-abdulkabir-aliu-foundation-aaf-integral-university-india-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-298":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},298,"abdulkabir-aliu-foundation-aaf-integral-university-india-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-298","Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation (aaf) Integral University India Scholarship 2026: Fully Funded","\u003Cp>The Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation, in partnership with Integral University, India, is offering fully funded scholarships to Nigerian students pursuing Master’s and PhD programs at the Integral University for the 2026\u002F2027 academic session.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The AAF Integral University India Scholarship covers tuition and living allowance fees, accommodation, medical insurance, visa processing and flight tickets fee.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>AAF Integral University India Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation,\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-asia\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Asia\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Asia\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fees\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa Processing\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Flight Tickets Fee\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 20, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation Integral University India Scholarship 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation, in partnership with Integral University, India, is offering fully funded scholarships to Nigerian students pursuing Master’s and PhD programs at the Integral University for the 2026\u002F2027 academic session.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship will cover the following: Tuition and living allowance fees Accommodation Medical insurance, Visa processing, Flight Tickets. The Master’s program is for 2 years, while the Ph.D program is for 3 years. Please note that students who are awaiting results\u002Ftranscripts are not eligible to apply.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>AAF Integral University India Scholarship 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The AAF Integral University India Scholarship offers the following benefits;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full tuition fees\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living allowances\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>On-campus accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Air travel (flight tickets)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa processing\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Eligible Programmes for Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation Integral University India Postgraduate Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship is awarded for all programmes offered at the Integral University India.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation Integral University India Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation Integral University India Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>This scheme is exclusively for undergraduate scholarship beneficiaries of all universities supported by Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation who graduated with a First Class or Second Class Upper (2:1) degree\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicant must be a Nigerian citizen from one of the six geopolitical regions\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicant must be proficient in English, with strong written and spoken communication skills.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of English proficiency (such as IELTS, TOEFL, or equivalent) may be required.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicant must be in good health\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicant must have no criminal record.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation Integral University India Scholarship 2026 Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Abdulkabir Aliu Foundation Integral University India Postgraduate Scholarship 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Valid International Passport (minimum 1 year’s validity)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Two letters of recommendation (from a Professor or HOD) and one from an Industry Expert, attesting to the applicant’s academic abilities, professional skills, and potential for success.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcript\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Statement of Purpose (SOP)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Undergraduate Degree (For Master’s Applicants)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Master’s Degree with Distinction (For PhD Applicants).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for AAF Integral University India Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the AAF Integral University India Scholarship 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare the required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Create an account on AAF portal or login into your account\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 20th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarship.abdulkabiraliufoundation.org\u002Fscheme-details.php?sid=81\">https:\u002F\u002Fscholarship.abdulkabiraliufoundation.org\u002Fscheme-details.php?sid=81\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-19 16:48:54",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fabdulkabir-aliu-foundation-aaf-integral-university-india-scholarship-2026-fully-funded\u002F6a3564e6085b90.12171095_screenshot 2026-06-19 163905.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fabdulkabir-aliu-foundation-aaf-integral-university-india-scholarship-2026-fully-funded\u002F6a3564e6085b90.12171095_screenshot%202026-06-19%20163905.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,48,58,67,76,85,93,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":9},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[44],{"fileName":45,"oldFileName":45,"type":18,"file":19,"url":46},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-fo